Subject: [PATCH 1/4] [feature](be) Add ObProcMaps cache for ob-kill60 native
 stack collector

Mirrors OceanBase's ObProcMaps so the coordinator can resolve PCs to DSO
offsets after capturing raw IPs in the signal handler. Cache lives in
be/src/common/ alongside phdr_cache.{h,cpp} and stack_trace.{h,cpp}: the
existing canonical home for signal/observability infrastructure inside
Doris BE.

Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_signal_struct.h:87-107
Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_signal_struct.cpp:52-88
---
